-	  the orientation switch for it. DisplayPort is not supported.
+	  Enable this to support the first combo PHY in the SERDES block of
+	  the Allwinner A733 SoC. The PHY carries the USB3 SuperSpeed lanes
+	  or the DisplayPort main link lanes to a Type-C connector and acts
